      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `e394796d874d598856d5e61b5b4a7fd260ca4fea0bac3f359bb0c68e27694219--45100do001_2008.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 3e91029307c3a3bf872ee3509442573336eb0ae40c6636ad6110e747263e760c | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 16e2f8ba2f2a218c55b73e4344ff92f73c942e79d84ded69efe853af3e64faab | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 02f9b0308cb72c0647e65ea17d713a4c79907a0c6b644e8bcdb3207a6d762656 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | decc8f1132cd2137e99ca9b174da4bf6aaa4074d7812c5e8e83dc8d75ad1e6b6 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 54a8ce05d6d511c04ae7f0ee70e50700bb3bdba42bbf250e4aeb524ce291289d | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 3be3511bedc30e95570651b95cf3e711f8ae29ceeb10bec99642011708ce4e20 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 691f6263b27ddcc693f321d1ae75dbc1c4447ed12e01c4166c2fe37d24312e71 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 10c3a7dbb996067e003f17c61fa7f338c4a7186a9c5829c6171f417bbbde8733 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
